# Everything under data/ stays on the machine that produced it. This repository
# is public, and data/ holds the scanned-register transcriptions, the marks and
# attendance backups taken before an overwrite, and — when the file store is
# used — the database itself. "data/*.json" only covered files sitting directly
# in data/, so the backup subdirectories and the transcription notes, all of
# which carry student names and roll numbers, were left exposed.
data/
node_modules/
.env
